    {
      "name": "images (OCR)",
      "description": "Images go straight to OCR (en, hi, ar): PNG, JPEG, TIFF (one page per TIFF page, CCITT fax TIFFs included), WebP, GIF (first frame), BMP, JPEG 2000, PNM, TGA. EXIF orientation is applied, so a sideways phone photo reads correctly, and transparent backgrounds are composited onto white. The response has the PDF shape with `kind: image`; every page's `ocr.reasons` entry is `image`.\n\nLimits: 64 megapixels per page (`OXIDE_API_MAX_IMAGE_PIXELS`, else `422 image-too-large`), 2000 TIFF pages. HEIC/HEIF (iPhone camera files), AVIF and JPEG XL are rejected with a `422 unsupported-format` that names the format: convert them to JPEG or PNG first.\n\nThe file sources point at the repo's test fixtures: set Postman's working directory to the repo root (Settings → General → Working directory) to send them as-is, or pick your own file.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/extract/text — image (multipart)",
          "request": {
            "description": "OCR text of an image. `lang=auto` probes the first page's text with every recognizer; set `lang` when you know the language. TGA has no signature: the uploaded filename (`.tga`) or `format=tga` identifies it.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/extract/text",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "extract", "text"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "description": "An image: PNG, JPEG, TIFF, WebP, GIF, BMP, JP2, PNM or TGA. The fixture is an English invoice scan.",
                  "src": "tests/fixtures/scan_en.png"
                },
                {
                  "key": "lang",
                  "value": "auto",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "auto | en | hi | ar"
                },
                {
                  "key": "ocr",
                  "value": "off",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "off returns no text; the image is still validated."
